ained to use the best equipment possible and for the lack of equipment too.<br /> <br /> Ninjas capacities are viewed as supernatural. Swarm have masteries.<br /> <br /> Ninjas are many, with masters leading many many many pupils from their academies. The name says all: Swarm. But also the academies that train everyone but not all are really good ninjas.<br /> <br /> The only thing I think swarm don\u2019t have is the use of alchemy and things like that, what would fit the super science side talents have and assassins don\u2019t. But it can be explained as not all ninjas being masters of alchemy and things like that, as they are Aether users, not assassins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T22:21:28-08:00","id":1504537,"title":"","content":"How open is Swarm about their existence? Is there great building in center of Tokyo with written on it 'Swarm Corporation